{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is a command-based RPG set in the Warring States period, one of the most fascinating eras in Japanese history. Enjoy various elements that capture the atmosphere of the Warring States period.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cfFreely choose your protagonist from 91 daimyo families or new warlords!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891910/extras/45d6c243b121f855bb5f41dcd36b6b00.avif?t=1771284690\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you can freely choose your protagonist from 91 daimyo houses or new warlords. Each daimyo house offers different protagonist abilities, the number and abilities of your retainers, the surrounding power dynamics, and the warlords who will join you in that region. This allows you to enjoy different story developments with each playthrough.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cfRecruit over 300 warlords and freely form your army!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891910/extras/24ba80bb68c5991b915dbeb097e42722.avif?t=1771284690\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous warlords who colored the Warring States period make an appearance. Over 300 of them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Independent generals may join your service after defeating them in battle. Generals belonging to other factions can also potentially join you after you conquer their faction. Gather numerous talented vassals and aim for unification!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cfForm your own army with your favorite generals!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891910/extras/fb0e434b0c18d13242c71cb489df73dc.avif?t=1771284690\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can form units at your faction's castle. You can also assign deputy commanders to generals in your units to enhance their abilities. Combine generals with various skills and abilities to form the strongest unit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cfTrain the strongest unit and enhance generals through equipment treasure hunting!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891910/extras/0eaf2640c142c52cfa2c81c1334efdec.avif?t=1771284690\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In battle scenes, use attribute skills such as spear, cavalry, archery, and strategy, as well as powerful unique skills to overwhelm enemy units. Enemy levels become stronger the farther you are from your base. However, there are no penalties for being defeated, so keep trying (except for some event battles).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891910/extras/a5b201f309c06b1d9fde0025d3b271f3.avif?t=1771284690\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, equipment can be obtained from enemy drops or certain events. Items are randomly assigned \u201cquality\u201d and \u201ctitles,\u201d so enjoy treasure hunting for divine equipment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cfConquer enemy castles in any order</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891910/extras/29480414ff63dc4f6504bd6d5efb3ff5.avif?t=1771284690\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The vast field map, based on an actual map of Japan, features enemy castles scattered across the landscape. Whether you choose to \u201cstart by defeating weaker forces to build your strength\u201d or \u201ctake down that famous warlord first to obtain their equipment,\u201d conquer enemy castles in any order you like and aim for national unification.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cfVarious events based on progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891910/extras/f4366c75d0a55d4b6c4bbb4cd792a067.avif?t=1771284690\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on your progress in conquering enemy forces, various events\u2014both good and bad\u2014will occur. Overcome them all and aim for national unification!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cfDiverse features supporting freedom!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891910/extras/0a7f991b7dddbc009974fdd1575c8319.avif?t=1771284690\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game implements various features for comfortable gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbNew Warlord Creation: Import original images, set warlord abilities and skills, and choose your starting region to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbDifficulty Adjustment: Choose between the standard Normal mode and the challenging Hard mode. For those seeking greater hardship, enjoy the solitary Lonely Mode with no subordinates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbDomestic Affairs: Appoint warlords as domestic affairs officers to gain advantageous effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbBlacksmith Feature: Randomly generate equipment and regenerate item titles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbTraining Feature: Level up your favorite generals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbFast Travel Feature: Travel instantly to your faction's castles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbNew Game+ Feature: Carry over one set of equipment when starting a new playthrough. Enjoy playing as various factions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience \u201cFreedom in the Warring States Era!\u201d in this game.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Beginning of Conquest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3891910/0066a3646494490f1298b26259e0d00ec6650d8d.jpg"},{"name":"Conquest in Full Swing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3891910/5c744083c6124c4a91a515598cd63bbb4435bc9a.jpg"},{"name":"Lord of a Quarter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3891910/034282334098db641ab2f5d25511b3b1cea5badf.jpg"},{"name":"Unification","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3891910/90001413540713ef5c241a227df96ef5fae68a80.jpg"},{"name":"Rule by Might","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3891910/f5a5e8eeb4d8735c7f7ed7248877c1df93e520f0.jpg"},{"name":"Local Lord Status","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3891910/5fd45e8cc9aa625689a8d3075e272a6737252e09.jpg"},{"name":"Regional Warlord Status","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3891910/a23a18b789c4176cd1a11c77d5631fe2b5459998.jpg"},{"name":"Great Warlord Status","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3891910/6a71e03c8db88696a804c7acdd27576ee01dbd2a.jpg"},{"name":"Charismatic Leader","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3891910/a1754c48a22d6f84d2e9276fb3bab4e8a780fb67.jpg"},{"name":"Rare Find","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3891910/73969d2eb0e0f6bff3c0e7ef4159e653032a59bd.jpg"}],"total":14},"backgrou